  "block.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger": "Fluid Exchanger",
  "tooltip.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger": "Left slot: an oil bucket or gas tank holding a fluid; right slot: 1 empty bucket.\nOut comes a bucket of that fluid (water -> Water Bucket, diesel -> Diesel Bucket; in theory any fluid works, as long as it has a bucket form of its own).\nFluids with no bucket form (crude oil / naphtha / LPG) are refused outright.\nFor gases (gas tank) hook up a Fluid Pump",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.empty": "[Fluid Exchanger] Left slot is empty (or the container holds nothing)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.invalid": "[Fluid Exchanger] That thing in the left slot is not a fluid container - an oil bucket or a gas tank is required!",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.output_full": "[Fluid Exchanger] The right slot needs 1 empty bucket - it becomes that fluid's bucket right there",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.running": "[Fluid Exchanger] Exchanging (3 s / 1000 mB)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.material": "[Fluid Exchanger] Less than 1000 mB in the left slot - it starts on its own once there is enough, progress kept",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.no_bucket": "[Fluid Exchanger] This fluid has no bucket (crude oil / naphtha / LPG live only in oil buckets)",
  "gui.potato_s_t.fluid_exchanger.status.gas": "[Fluid Exchanger] The left slot holds a gas - the GUI does not deal with gases, hook up a Fluid Pump",
