  "gui.potato_s_t.distillation.status.product_full": "Product tanks full",
  "tooltip.potato_s_t.distillation_controller": "Structure 4x4x7, 7 layers:\n- Layers 1-2: Common Metal Block on the four corners\n- Layers 3 / 5: corners = Common Metal Block, edges = Heat-Resistant Metal Block, centre 2x2 = Heater\n- Layers 4 / 6: a ring of Heat-Resistant Metal Block (hollow)\n- Layer 7: 4x4 of Common Metal Block\n- Every cell drawn empty on the blueprint must be air\nScan range: 32x32x10 around itself. It counts the towers and reports the number to an adjacent Operator.",
  "tooltip.potato_s_t.distillation_operator": "Per tower: 12 buckets of oil, 2.5 buckets of each product.\nA redstone signal starts it; it recognises up to 4 towers.",
  "gui.potato_s_t.distillation.diagnosis.found": "Detected %s distillation tower(s) - up to 4",
  "gui.potato_s_t.distillation.diagnosis.none": "No tower found: the closest candidate is wrong in %s of 112 cells - layer %s, row %s, column %s (at %s) should be '%s' but is '%s'",
