  "tooltip.potato_s_t.salt_dryer": "In an ocean or salty river biome, at Y 0-64 and with a water source below, it produces 1 Sea Salt every 120 seconds.\nFeed it FE and that drops to one every 20 seconds. Sunshine is free, but electricity is faster.",
