  "advancements.potato_s_t.oil_pump.description": "In an Ocean Oilfield, with a waterlogged chain below: that chain is n - drawing 8n²+80n FE/t for 10n mB/s",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.oil_pump.title": "Oil From Beneath the Sea",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.salt.description": "Grandfather Sun is now squeezing the sea for its ingredients - maybe add some electricity?",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.salt.title": "Demand Salt from the Sea",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.star_steel.description": "This is absolutely not a product of Earth",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.star_steel.title": "Forge the Star Steel",
  "advancements.potato_s_t.star_steel_armor.description": "Wear the whole set for the toughest armour in the mod - and it does not wear down at night",
